// Rule: [T1036.005] Matchboil - Matchboil Payload Config Artifacts
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1036.005
// Classification: Hunting query
// Status: Untested implementation sketch
// Primary platform: Microsoft Defender XDR
// Required telemetry: DeviceFileEvents
// Purpose: Hunts source-observed MATCHBOIL payload and configuration artifacts.
// Logic: Evaluate DeviceFileEvents for matchboil payload config artifacts using the existing source-derived conditions while preserving projected investigation context.
// A match proves: A result proves that the published query conditions matched in DeviceFileEvents; it is an investigative event, not a malicious verdict.
// A match does not prove: execution, persistence, C2 communication, compromise, or UAC-0099 attribution.
// Expected false positives: authorized administration, approved software, testing, or benign artifact collisions.
// Coverage limits: local schema, field population, retention, collection scope, and attacker variation require validation.
// Evidence claims: C001, C002, C003
//
// MATCHBOIL payload and configuration artifact hunt
// Platform: Microsoft Defender XDR Advanced Hunting
// Status: Hunting query - Untested implementation sketch
// Confidence: Medium
// Telemetry prerequisite: Microsoft Defender for Endpoint populating DeviceFileEvents
// Scope: Use the portal time selector appropriate to local retention and the investigation.
// Interpretation: A row is an artifact match. It does not prove execution, persistence,
// C2 communication, compromise, or UAC-0099 attribution.
DeviceFileEvents
| where
    (FileName == "SMTPClientApplication.exe"
        and FolderPath endswith @"\AppData\Local\SMTPClient")
    or (FileName == "config.library-ms"
        and FolderPath == @"C:\Users\Public\Libraries")
    or (FileName == "WallpappersSet.jpg"
        and FolderPath endswith @"\Pictures")
| project Timestamp, DeviceId, DeviceName, ActionType, FileName, FolderPath,
          SHA1, InitiatingProcessFileName, InitiatingProcessCommandLine,
          InitiatingProcessAccountName
| order by Timestamp desc
